## Attribution Requirements

When using this software under the Non-Commercial License, you must:

1. **Provide Credit**: Include a reference to "Eric LoRA Catalog" and the author "Eric Hiss"
2. **Link to Source**: Provide a link to the original repository (https://github.com/EricRollei/Eric_LoRA_Catalog)
3. **Indicate Changes**: If you modified the software, clearly indicate what changes were made
4. **License Notice**: Include a copy of or link to this license

Example attribution:
```
LoRAs catalogued with Eric LoRA Catalog
by Eric Hiss (https://github.com/EricRollei/Eric_LoRA_Catalog)
Licensed under CC BY-NC 4.0
```

